# Close-up of the voxel island with camera effects: shallow depth of field
# through a six-bladed aperture (the miniature look), bloom around the
# lantern and a vignette. Focused on the lantern.

image_width 800
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 128
max_depth 16
camera lookfrom 34 22 30 lookat 9 12 6 vup 0 1 0 vfov 30
camera aperture 1.2 focus 35 blades 6 blade_rotation 15
tonemap aces
bloom 0.4 threshold 1 radius 0.05
vignette 0.4
sun elevation 25 azimuth 200 intensity 3 angle 4
sky uniform 0.35 0.45 0.65
material ground lambertian 0.3 0.3 0.3
ground ground
vox models/island.vox
